# Conformance probe pack for the mapping rules of spec 0.6 on the `protobuf`
# wire. Public. No kinds. Exercises `typemap` on the protobuf wire (ruling 18 of
# 0.5), a value table from a varint to a model string, `default`, `const`, and
# one key at two paths.
format   conformance-rules-protobuf
version  0.6.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses     track
wire     protobuf
field    uid          1    pstring
field    type         2    pstring               # through the pack-wide typemap
field    track.class  3    pvarint  via class
field    lat          4.1  pdouble
field    lat          5    pdouble               # the same key at a second path
field    speed_ms     6    pfloat
const    4.3  1
const    7    3
default  track.class  bird                       # written as 2
typemap  FRND a-f-G
map      class  1  uas
map      class  2  bird
